  "findings": [],
  "acceptedBySourceRead": [
    "HSK1 native CLI comes from hsk1-app/node_modules; HSK1 wrapper imports the original HSK1 config without importing the course-app Playwright package. HSK1 test imports resolve under hsk1-app. HSK2/3 wrapper, original configs and tests use course-app Playwright.",
    "Before requires checkout HEAD equal GITHUB_SHA; official and extended source snapshots are checked against actual HEAD Git blobs and file modes. Extended scopes include original/wrapper configs, test files and HSK1 harness HTML. Builds and after reject source drift; after rehashes full built output inventories.",
    "Every required command has a separate stdout/stderr log, exit code, signal/spawn-error and SHA-bound log ref. The after phase reads all 18 required command files; absent, failed or corrupted command records cannot produce accepted after evidence.",
    "Verifier rejects collection-only results, skips, retry/repeat configuration or actual retries, expected failures, failed/interrupted statuses, global/per-test errors, wrong project/engine/file, count mismatch, duplicated IDs and flaky statistics.",
    "HSK1 tests explicitly consume an auth-free Vite source harness at 18911; its independent compiled dist is separately built and hashed. HSK2/3 tests consume the actual isolated compiled preview at 4179. Neither is described as full production release acceptance.",
    "Both installed Playwright packages are lock/version checked at 1.62.1; browser revision descriptors must match; actual launch-entry existence/hash is recorded with explicit limitation that it is not all browser/system library bytes.",
    "Upload paths contain the real per-engine command logs/records, before/builds/after or failure manifests, Playwright JSON, native output/screenshots/traces and specified HSK1 screenshots. Compiled HTML/JS/CSS/JSON consumers are included; full media/package bytes are not claimed by this partial consumer upload.",
    "No deployment, merge or release command exists; successful after evidence explicitly keeps publicationApproved:false and deployed:false.",
    "Before rejects any HSK_BROWSER_PATH override; font-install is also a required successful command. The actual final command-record set has 18 entries."
  ],
